  "description": "Han Ji-Tae is a naive twenty-year-old dominant Alpha caught between two possessive men: Ju Kang-U, the older Omega lover who snatched his virginity, and Woo Hyeon-Seung, the devoted Beta bodyguard who spent eight years watching over him before falling blindly in love. Hyeon-Seung despises Kang-U’s bad influence, Kang-U hates Hyeon-Seung’s interference, and both have secretly claimed Ji-Tae's body in a frenzy of jealousy. But Ji-Tae isn't planning on choosing between them. Now, two shameless men find themselves forced into a tangled, three-way dynamic where sharing is the only option.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
